<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Your spot has become available!</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family:
          -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica,
          Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f3f4f6;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
        color: #1f2937;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 32px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow:
          0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),
          0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      }
      .header {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #111827;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .content {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #4b5563;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .details-card {
        background-color: #f9fafb;
        border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        font-size: 15px;
      }
      .details-row {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .details-row:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }
      .label {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #374151;
      }
      .button-container {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 32px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }
      .button {
        background-color: #3b82f6;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 14px 28px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        display: inline-block;
      }
      .footer {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #9ca3af;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        padding-top: 20px;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">🔥Your spot has become available!</div>

      <div class="content">
        Hi, <strong><%= username %></strong>!<br /><br />
        We have great news! Someone has cancelled their unpaid booking, and the
        workspace you were waiting for is now available for booking.
      </div>

      <div class="details-card">
        <div class="details-row">
          <span class="label">Workspace:</span> <%= workspaceTitle %>
        </div>
        <div class="details-row">
          <span class="label">Start time:</span> <%= startTime %>
        </div>
        <div class="details-row">
          <span class="label">End time:</span> <%= endTime %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        Hurry up — other users from the waitlist have also received this email,
        and the spot may be taken by someone else!
      </div>

      <div class="button-container">
        <a href="<%= bookUrl %>" class="button">Book now</a>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        Best regards,<br />
        Flexispace Team<br /><br />
        <small
          >If you have already changed your mind or booked another spot, just
          ignore this email.</small
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
